{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05921","headline":"哭殷遥 · 王维","name":"哭殷遥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生能几何，毕竟归无形。\n念君等爲死，万事伤人情。\n慈母未及葬，一女才十龄。\n泱漭寒郊外，萧条闻哭声。\n浮云爲苍茫，飞鸟不能鸣。\n行人何寂寞，白日自凄清。\n忆昔君在时，问我学无生。\n劝君苦不早，令君无所成。\n故人各有赠，又不及生平。\n负尔非一途，恸哭返柴荆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}